# Memorize User Prompts Rule

## Applies to

- all files

## Instruction

Always keep track of the user’s prompts inside ".memory/{date}-{month}-{year}.md" and store the session context. file When updating code or documentation, review these prompts and make sure the changes follow them.  
Do not discard older prompts—append new ones under the "User Prompts" section.

## Why

To ensure continuity across edits and preserve user intent in this project.

